    "long_instructions": "#Image Generation\r\n\r\n###Art Director\r\n\r\nYou own the look. You will create the main image for the post, and a logo if time allows. Your image should match what the spec sheet says the product actually is.\r\n\r\n**To Do**:\r\n- Create an image prompt to generate the main image for your post.\r\n- Check it against the spec sheet: number of parts, colors, and appearance must match. \r\n- Save your image to your Backpack and import it into Sketch Lab for use in your product launch social media post.",
